                      "fill": "$text-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "I've spent the last 10 years building products for startups and agencies. I started with PHP, Laravel and jQuery in 2016, moved through Vue and AngularJS, then specialized in React and React Native. Today I own full features end to end with Next.js and NestJS: database, API, web and mobile.",
